    (uuid "545bf658-f654-5dca-8334-3205cdfb466e"))
  (text "J30 mates to J30; J31 mates to J31, same pin number to same pin number.\n5 V: elevation PS4 -> controller. 3.3 V: controller buck -> elevation MCU-side logic.\nAll signal returns use GND_STM32 / controller GND. No field return crosses these connectors.\nMechanical definition: assembly/stack_interface.json. Nominal facing-board gap: 12 mm."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 172.72 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "83129e4f-88d3-58fa-ae66-bc76695ada00"))
  (text "Startup biases are on the elevation board, beside the existing isolators.\nDrive disables and CAN silent default high; brake releases and STEP default low.\nSSI clocks and encoder preset controls idle high. I2C pull-ups remain on elevation.\nJ31-19 carries NRST to a test point; SWD and USB stay on the controller."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 205.74 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "93b81f50-16f8-5106-9636-7989c9336d4e"))
